# Practice (Calm) and the round's actions: a hint (H) marks the perfect
# window, a finger's tap on the tray's Drop places a slab, Undo (U) takes it
# back, Pause (P) opens the pause screen and P resumes; then Leave round ends
# the round to its results.
until 300 Play
frames 5
click Play
until 60 Practice
frames 5
click Practice
until 60 Endless rehearsal
frames 5
click Calm
frames 150
key KeyH 2
until 30 perfect window marked
save hint
frames 5
touch Drop
until 30 HEIGHT1
key KeyU 2
until 30 drop undone
expect HEIGHT0
key KeyP 2
until 60 Restart round
frames 5
save practice-paused
key KeyP 2
until 60 Drop
frames 5
key Escape 2
until 60 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
until 120 Round over
expect you left the round
save practice-results
